{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-1631b7e8e219f56ea960","title":"景初元年孟康荐崔林为公辅","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-1631b7e8e219f56ea960","label":"正文","text":"景初元年孟康荐崔林为公辅","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0020","role":"推荐","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0053","role":"被荐","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"景初元年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条明文纪年；未审定对应公元年。","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9","order":4922}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0053","name":"崔林","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"rensu-p0020","name":"孟康","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-052318a44f11fc04586f","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年，司徒、司空并缺，散骑侍郎孟康荐林曰：“夫宰相者〖15〗，天下之所瞻效；诚宜得秉忠履正本德仗义之士，足为海内所师表者。窃见司隶校尉崔林，禀自然之正性，体高雅之弘量。论其所长以比古人：忠直不回，则史鱼之俦〖16〗；清俭守约，则季文之匹也〖17〗。牧守州郡，所在而治；及为外司〖18〗，万里肃齐〖19〗；减台辅之妙器〖20〗，衮职之良才也〖21〗。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
